{"start":"t:lg","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִגְדַּל אֱלֹהִים חַי וְיִשְׁתַּבַּח נִמְצָא וְאֵין עֵת אֶל־מְצִיאוּתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אֶחָד וְאֵין יָחִיד כְּיִחוּדוֹ נֶעְלָם וְגַם אֵין סוֹף לְאַחְדּוּתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אֵין לוֹ דְּמוּת הַגּוּף וְאֵינוֹ גוּף לֹא נַעֲרוֹךְ אֵלָיו קְדֻשָּׁתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"קַדְמוֹן לְכָל־דָּבָר אֲשֶׁר נִבְרָא רִאשׁוֹן וְאֵין רֵאשִׁית לְרֵאשִׁיתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הִנּוֹ אֲדוֹן עוֹלָם וְכָל־נוֹצָר יוֹרֶה גְדֻלָּתוֹ וּמַלְכוּתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שֶׁפַע נְבוּאָתוֹ נְתָנוֹ אֶל אַנְשֵׁי סְגֻלָּתוֹ וְתִפְאַרְתּוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֹא קָם בְּיִשְׂרָאֵל כְּמֹשֶׁה עוֹד נָבִיא וּמַבִּיט אֶת־תְּמוּנָתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"תּוֹרַת אֱמֶת נָתַן לְעַמּוֹ אֵל עַל־יַד נְבִיאוֹ נֶאֱמַן בֵּיתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֹא יַחֲלִיף הָאֵל וְלֹא יָמִיר דָּתוֹ לְעוֹלָמִים לְזוּלָתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"צוֹפֶה וְיוֹדֵעַ סְתָרֵינוּ מַבִּיט לְסוֹף דָּבָר בְּקַדְמָתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"גּוֹמֵל לְאִישׁ חֶסֶד כְּמִפְעָלוֹ נוֹתֵן לְרָשָׁע רַע כְּרִשְׁעָתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִשְׁלַח לְקֵץ יָמִין מְשִׁיחֵנוּ לִפְדּוֹת מְחַכֵּי קֵץ יְשׁוּעָתוֹ: "}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:l","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מֵתִים יְחַיֶּה אֵל בְּרֹב חַסְדּוֹ בָּרוּךְ עֲדֵי־עַד שֵׁם תְּהִלָּתוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:l"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"end":"t:lg"}
